            "Do not overlay screenshot registration and SRDB coordinates without a verified transform.",
            "Move compact raw Goethite and Crude through separate item-specific Cargo links and process them beside Grand Basin consumers.",
            "Treat the July 8 remote-resource calculations as historical evidence; rerun exact late-campaign quantities against the canonical RuptureOps snapshot before app publication."
          ],
          "open_questions": [
            "A verified screenshot-to-SRDB coordinate transform is still absent.",
