            "After Engine access and Selenian 9, establish the preferred three-node Goethite satellite and charge its Receiver buffer before enabling exact-rate processing.",
            "After Future Health 11, establish the first Oil satellite and its single GB-A Refinery path.",
            "Add fallback extraction only when measured campaign recovery requires it."
